<p>
  Hi <%= @user.display_login %>,
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3 tmp-mt-3">
  Your <%= Copilot.individual_product_name %> plan expires in one week and won't renew automatically.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  When it does, your account will transition to Copilot Free. You'll still have access to Copilot at no cost, but your paid plan benefits &mdash; including model choices and higher usage &mdash; will end.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3"><strong>You still have time to switch</strong></p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  If you'd like uninterrupted access to the full Copilot experience, switch to a monthly Copilot Pro or Pro+ plan before your annual plan expires. You'll receive prorated credits for the remaining value of your annual subscription that can be used throughout the lifetime of your Copilot subscription.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  &bull; Copilot Pro: $<%= Copilot::COPILOT_PRO_MONTHLY_BASE_PRICE %>/month (see <%= link_to "pricing page", "https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" %> for more plan details and current pricing)<br>
  &bull; Copilot Pro+: $<%= Copilot::COPILOT_PRO_PLUS_MONTHLY_BASE_PRICE %>/month (see <%= link_to "pricing page", "https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" %> for more plan details and current pricing)
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3"><strong>Next steps</strong></p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  &bull; Switch to monthly or manage your plan: <%= link_to @settings_user_billing_path, @settings_user_billing_path %><br>
  &bull; Learn more about plan options: <%= link_to Copilot::COPILOT_FOR_INDIVIDUALS_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION, Copilot::COPILOT_FOR_INDIVIDUALS_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION %><br>
  &bull; Read the billing documentation: <%= link_to Copilot::COPILOT_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION, Copilot::COPILOT_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION %><br>
  &bull; Read the blog post &amp; FAQ: <%= link_to "GitHub Copilot is moving to usage-based billing", "https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/github-copilot-is-moving-to-usage-based-billing/" %>
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  We appreciate you being part of the Copilot community.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  The GitHub Team
</p>
